OL,3,ANearly 100 Labour MPs including
OL,4,Aministerial aides oppose Rosebank oil
OL,5,Afield
OL,6,
OL,7,FMinisterial aides are among nearly 100
OL,8,FLabour MPs who have signed a letter to
OL,9,Fthe prime minister to express their
OL,10,Fopposition to the Rosebank oil field.
OL,12,FThe government could also face
OL,13,Fresignations from junior ranks if the
OL,14,Fproject goes ahead, the BBC has been
OL,15,Ftold.
OL,17,FEnergy Secretary Miatta Fahnbulleh is
OL,18,Fdue to make a decision on whether to
OL,19,Fgive the go-ahead for drilling in the
OL,20,Foil field off the north-west coast of
OL,21,FShetland within weeks.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
