OL,3,ANearly 100 Labour MPs including
OL,4,Aministerial aides oppose Rosebank oil
OL,5,Afield
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government has remained
OL,8,Ftight-lipped - both publicly and
OL,9,Fprivately - about what it is likely to
OL,10,Fdo.
